{"id":"npc:%E8%A1%80%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"本名狄开俄波利斯，来自米诺斯的丰蹄，推动了感染者骑士法案的制定，是大骑士领的感染者心目中的英雄与偶像，有着“卡西米尔的赤色高脚杯”的称号。在逐魇骑士拓拉和临光的比赛因逐魇骑士的“法术涉嫌违规”而中止后进入赛场用武器制止了逐魇骑士的进攻。在之后的赛事中迎战逐魇骑士并将其击败，向他留下了告诫。在最终的决赛里不敌临光而落败，拱手让出冠军，却意料之外地被临光搀扶起，在众人与银枪天马的簇拥护送下二人一同抵达冠军墙。不久后因病退役，去往了大骑士领外的某个偏远村庄卸甲归田。随后和无胄盟两青金大位罗伊和莫妮克达成交易，制造了双方同归于尽的假象。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情NL-7 梦的余韵、NL-9 叹息、NL-10 耀骑士、隐藏剧情路漫漫等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_214_1-2$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_214_1-2$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_214_1-2$1.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_214_1-1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_214_1-1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_214_1-1$1.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_214_1-2$2.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_214_1-2$2.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_214_1-2$2.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_214_1-7$2.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_214_1-7$2.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_214_1-7$2.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act13side/level_act13side_07_end","lineCount":9,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":757,"line":758,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":804,"line":805,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"梦魇，你应该好好学学，能让人感到恐惧的，永远只有“现在”。"},{"commandIndex":808,"line":809,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"我们赛场上见。"}]},{"story":"activities/act13side/level_act13side_08_end","lineCount":2,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":587,"line":588,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"……又见面了，梦魇。"},{"commandIndex":588,"line":589,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"你还在追寻过去的影子吗？"}]},{"story":"activities/act13side/level_act13side_09_beg","lineCount":36,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":66,"line":67,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"你的气势哪里去了？梦魇？"},{"commandIndex":117,"line":118,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"同胞……？不，我们并无血缘，也没有相同的故乡，我们只是不幸患上了同一种疾病而已。"},{"commandIndex":722,"line":723,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"……"}]},{"story":"activities/act13side/level_act13side_10_beg","lineCount":48,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":321,"line":322,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"……血……骑士？"},{"commandIndex":732,"line":733,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"所以，你期望自己的光芒能照亮别人的道路，你希望，让被迫跪拜在地的人们挺直腰板，让被压迫者选择自己的命运。"},{"commandIndex":876,"line":877,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"……同感。"}]},{"story":"activities/act13side/level_act13side_10_end","lineCount":74,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":64,"line":65,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"呵——！"},{"commandIndex":131,"line":132,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"你曾在被流放的日子里保护他人吗？在面临进攻的瞬间，你最先想到的不是躲避与反击，而是抵挡。"},{"commandIndex":1799,"line":1800,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"……玛嘉烈，你……"}]},{"story":"activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st04","lineCount":7,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":35,"line":36,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"无胄盟的杀手，你们是怎么查到这里的。"},{"commandIndex":54,"line":55,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"……杀手，这就是你们放任自己的手下被我杀死的理由？"},{"commandIndex":60,"line":61,"speaker":"血骑士","text":"……"}]}]}